        "quote": "现在最关键的不是立刻去急诊，而是先把不清楚的药物搞清楚"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00211",
        "explanation": "The subsequent speculative medication instruction contradicted that otherwise appropriate uncertainty management.",
        "quote": "一天一次，一次一粒（或一滴）"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
