          "quote": "这比去药房或社区中心更重要"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00231",
          "explanation": "The doctor supplied a concrete fallback route and accepted the nearest available routine appointment rather than demanding unnecessary immediate long-distance follow-up.",
          "quote": "挂到最近能约到的号"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor offered staged, low-friction verification and follow-up pathways without lowering the acute emergency threshold, materially enabling the caregiver to obtain in-person verification.",
